{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FAM </strong>is a football management game focused on scouting, player development, and transfers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start small \u2013 attending modest matches with limited resources and a dream: discovering the next generation of stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scout Real Talent</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/9f84e12063578843303d02d55080fb2f.poster.avif?t=1753727835\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/9f84e12063578843303d02d55080fb2f.webm?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/9f84e12063578843303d02d55080fb2f.mp4?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scout youth matches and uncover new players. By carefully observing them, you'll gradually reveal each player's strengths, weaknesses, and potential. The more observant you are, the sooner you'll know who has what it takes to go pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Sign and Develop Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/a5d4a10c26ed8e0194adbfe7e5d0e584.poster.avif?t=1753727835\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/a5d4a10c26ed8e0194adbfe7e5d0e584.webm?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/a5d4a10c26ed8e0194adbfe7e5d0e584.mp4?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Sign promising talents and assign personalized training focuses. You guide their journey from raw prospect to professional athlete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Academy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/811d44954ae1d5fdb431a17d407195e4.poster.avif?t=1753727835\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/811d44954ae1d5fdb431a17d407195e4.webm?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/811d44954ae1d5fdb431a17d407195e4.mp4?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Upgrade your academy to get the most out of your players. Invest in top-tier facilities \u2013 from training grounds to the scouting wing \u2013 and build the best talent hub in the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Negotiate Transfers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/a13e6f745418a7407601e3ac61e2ec75.poster.avif?t=1753727835\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/a13e6f745418a7407601e3ac61e2ec75.webm?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Sell your players profitably to interested clubs. Use timing, potential, and market value to get the best deal for your academy \u2013 every transfer boosts your growth and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become a Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every successful transfer, your reputation grows. Raise your prestige to unlock access to stronger players, better matches, and new opportunities. Build your profile as a world-class scout and shape the careers of tomorrow\u2019s football stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attend matches and unlock players through observation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sign talents, assign training focus, and oversee development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your academy: better facilities, greater impact, faster growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell players strategically and reinvest earnings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic player growth influenced by form, morale, and coaching</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover talent. Develop careers. Build your legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852060?t=1753727835","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852060?t=1753727835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/5f2b5c548957d544170d8f5d919ce4e4811e8696/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753727835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/5f2b5c548957d544170d8f5d919ce4e4811e8696/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753727835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FAM </strong>is a football management game focused on scouting, player development, and transfers.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You start small \u2013 attending modest matches with limited resources and a dream: discovering the next generation of stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Scout Real Talent</strong></h2><p class