team/apps/3852060/extras/811d44954ae1d5fdb431a17d407195e4.poster.avif?t=1753727835\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/811d44954ae1d5fdb431a17d407195e4.webm?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/811d44954ae1d5fdb431a17d407195e4.mp4?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Upgrade your academy to get the most out of your players. Invest in top-tier facilities \u2013 from training grounds to the scouting wing \u2013 and build the best talent hub in the league.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Negotiate Transfers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/a13e6f745418a7407601e3ac61e2ec75.poster.avif?t=1753727835\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/extras/a13e6f745418a7407601e3ac61e2ec75.webm?t=1753727835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Sell your players profitably to interested clubs. Use timing, potential, and market value to get the best deal for your academy \u2013 every transfer boosts your growth and reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become a Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every successful transfer, your reputation grows. Raise your prestige to unlock access to stronger players, better matches, and new opportunities. Build your profile as a world-class scout and shape the careers of tomorrow\u2019s football stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Attend matches and unlock players through observation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sign talents, assign training focus, and oversee development</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your academy: better facilities, greater impact, faster growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sell players strategically and reinvest earnings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic player growth influenced by form, morale, and coaching</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover talent. Develop careers. Build your legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Hubi"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852060/fc776a50612161071768cff312cfcd2b1e71683c/header.jpg?t=1753727835","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Football Academy Manager","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-Core CPU (e.g., Intel i3)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics (Intel HD Graphics)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated or dedicated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Hubi"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"c